# The scenes of the real-databases-in-tests deck, in order. Each "## Scene N: title" is one slide, spoken with item N of
# real-databases-in-tests.narration.md. Each line under a heading puts one thing on the slide:
#   note "<text>"         a line of text
#   show <file> ...       a code panel: <from> <to> or /pattern/, then a label; --mark and --zoom mark lines
#   run_live "<command>"  a live run, played from its cast in real-databases-in-tests.outputs/
#   callout "<text>"      a boxed sentence saying what a result means

## Scene 1: step 1, the version catalogue
note "Step 1: add Testcontainers, the PostgreSQL driver, and H2 to the version catalogue."
show libs.versions.toml "/testcontainers|postgresql|h2/" gradle/libs.versions.toml

## Scene 2: step 2, a suite for container tests
note "Step 2: container tests get their own suite, so tests that need no containers stay quick."
show lessons/real-databases-in-tests/example/build.gradle.kts "/^testing/" "lesson build file" --zoom 17-22

## Scene 3: the code under test
note "The code under test: today's query. Who should sales call first? Oldest order first."
show CustomerRepository 15 17 "today's query" --zoom 15-17

## Scene 4: the test on an in-memory database
note "A test on *H2*, a database held in memory: quick, and not the database production uses."
show InMemoryDatabaseTest 13 24 "the test on H2" --zoom 15-16

## Scene 5: the test on real PostgreSQL
note "The same test on *real PostgreSQL*, started in a container for the test, and thrown away after."
show RealPostgresTest 18 34 "the test on PostgreSQL" --zoom 21-25

## Scene 6: PostgreSQL disagrees
note "Run both suites against today's query:"
run_live "./gradlew :lessons:real-databases-in-tests:test :lessons:real-databases-in-tests:integrationTest -Pcode=today"
callout "H2 puts customers who never ordered first. PostgreSQL puts them last: sales would never call them."

## Scene 7: the fixed query
note "The query that says where customers who never ordered belong:"
show CustomerRepository 19 21 "the fixed query" --zoom 19-21
run_live "./gradlew :lessons:real-databases-in-tests:test :lessons:real-databases-in-tests:integrationTest"
callout "Both databases agree, because the query no longer leaves it to the database."
